{"speciesId":610,"names":{"fr":"Coupenotte","es":"Axew","en":"Axew","ja":"キバゴ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il broie les Baies à grands coups de crocs. Ceux-ci repoussent plusieurs fois, toujours plus forts et aiguisés."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il laisse la marque de ses crocs dans les arbres pour marquer son territoire. Ses crocs repoussent dès qu’ils tombent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its large tusks have a tendency to break, but each time they grow back, they grow in harder and sturdier."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its large tusks have a tendency to break, but each time they grow back, they grow in harder and sturdier."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il broie les Baies à grands coups de crocs. Ceux-ci repoussent plusieurs fois, toujours plus forts et aiguisés."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Usa sus colmillos para romper las bayas que come. Estos se regeneran una y otra vez, por eso son tan fuertes y afilados."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"木の実を キバで 砕いて 食べる。 何回も 生え変わることで 強く 鋭い キバに なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il laisse la marque de ses crocs dans les arbres pour marquer son territoire. Ses crocs repoussent dès qu’ils tombent."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Deja la huella de sus colmillos en los árboles para marcar su territorio. Si se le rompen, se regeneran muy rápido."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"キバで 樹木に 傷を つけて 縄張りの 目印にする。 キバは 折れても すぐに 生える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il broie les Baies à grands coups de crocs. Ceux-ci repoussent plusieurs fois, toujours plus forts et aiguisés."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Usa sus colmillos para romper las bayas que come. Estos se regeneran una y otra vez, por eso son tan fuertes y afilados."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"木の実を キバで 砕いて 食べる。 何回も 生え変わることで 強く 鋭い キバに なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il laisse la marque de ses crocs dans les arbres pour marquer son territoire. Ses crocs repoussent dès qu’ils tombent."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Deja la huella de sus colmillos en los árboles para marcar su territorio. Si se le rompen, se regeneran muy rápido."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"キバで 樹木に 傷を つけて 縄張りの 目印にする。 キバは 折れても すぐに 生える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il vit dans des terriers qu’il creuse à même le sol, et organise des concours avec ses camarades pour voir qui peut briser la Baie la plus dure."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Viven en madrigueras que construyen bajo tierra. Compiten entre ellos para ver quién logra abrir con los colmillos las bayas más duras."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"These Pokémon nest in the ground and use their tusks to crush hard berries. Crushing berries is also how they test each other’s strength."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"地面に つくった 巣穴に 棲む。 硬い 木の実を キバで 砕いて 仲間と 力を 比べあう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il joue avec ses congénères à se donner de grands coups de crocs. Peu importe s’ils se cassent : ils repousseront aussitôt."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Juega con sus congéneres chocando sus enormes colmillos con la tranquilidad de saber que, si se le rompen, se regenerarán enseguida."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"They play with each other by knocking their large tusks together. Their tusks break sometimes, but they grow back so quickly that it isn’t a concern."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"大きな キバを 打ちつけ 仲間と じゃれあう。 キバは 折れても すぐ 生えてくるから へっちゃらだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":610,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"guillotine","learns":[[11,"level-up",51],[14,"level-up",51],[15,"level-up",50],[16,"level-up",50],[17,"level-up",50],[18,"level-up",50],[20,"level-up",45],[25,"level-up",45]]},{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[11,"level-up",46],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",46],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",46],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",46],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",46],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",46],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",39],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",39],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",3]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"m